sigma_0 (ratio <= eps/6 = 1/60) against the parameter count P, at E = 10, K = 12:
  r=0.1, P=    10: sigma_0 = 0.13843
  r=0.1, P=   100: sigma_0 = 0.043759
  r=0.1, P=  1000: sigma_0 = 0.013837
  r=0.1, P= 10000: sigma_0 = 0.0043757
